  "solution": "Given:\n\n5 ÷ 10 of 10 × 4 + 4 ÷ 4 of 4 × 10 + (10 - 4) ÷ 16 × 4\n\nConcept used:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/36648f6d9fd5d1d56959b630c72b514ab488f27d2525de3370bb428cc41cf8e9.png] \n\nCalculation:\n\n5 ÷ 10 of 10 × 4 + 4 ÷ 4 of 4 × 10 + (10 - 4) ÷ 16 × 4\n\n⇒ 5 ÷ 100 × 4 + 4 ÷ 16 × 10 + 6 ÷ 16 × 4\n\n⇒ 0.05 × 4 + 0.25 × 10 + 0.375 × 4\n\n⇒ 0.2 + 2.5 + 1.5\n\n⇒ 4.2\n\n⇒ 42/10\n\n⇒ (21)/(5)\n\n**∴ The value of 5 ÷ 10 of 10 × 4 + 4 ÷ 4 of 4 × 10 + (10 - 4) ÷ 16 × 4 is (21)/(5).**",
